% professional advice. Its authors accept no liability for any loss or damage
% arising from its use.

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 7.

the actions are:
    the move left with *a person* is made; known as left_1.
    the move left with *a person* and *a second person* is made; known as left_2.
    the move right with *a person* is made; known as right_1.
    the move right with *a person* and *a second person* is made; known as right_2.

the fluents are:
    *a thing* is a clock; known as clock.
    *a thing* is a control; known as control.
    *a thing* is current; known as current.
    *a thing* is the location of *a second thing*; known as location.
    *a thing* is a torch; known as torch.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    the move left with *a person* is legal; known as legal_left_1.
    the move left with *a person* and *a second person* is legal; known as legal_left_2.
    the move right with *a person* is legal; known as legal_right_1.
    the move right with *a person* and *a second person* is legal; known as legal_right_2.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.

the templates are:
    the pace of *a thing* is *a second thing*.
    the succ of *a thing* is *a second thing*.

the knowledge base bridgecrossing includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/bridgecrossing.hrf".

the pace of "a" is 1.

the pace of b is 2.

the pace of c is 5.

the pace of d is 10.

the succ of 1 is 2.

the succ of 2 is 3.

the succ of 3 is 4.

the succ of 4 is 5.

the succ of 5 is 6.

the move left with a person is legal at a time if
    right is a torch at the time
    and the person is the location of right at the time.

the move right with a person is legal at a time if
    left is a torch at the time
    and the person is the location of left at the time.

the move left with a person and a second person is legal at a time if
    right is a torch at the time
    and the person is the location of right at the time
    and the second person is the location of right at the time.

the move right with a person and a second person is legal at a time if
    left is a torch at the time
    and the person is the location of left at the time
    and the second person is the location of left at the time.

the goal of robot is 100 at a time if
    a second thing is the count of each a thing such that
        the thing is the location of right at the time
    and the second thing is equal to 4
    and a third thing is a clock at the time
    and the third thing <= 17.

the game is terminal at a time if
    6 is current at the time.

when the move left with a person is made
then left is a torch
    and the person is the location of left
    and it is not the case that right is a torch
    and it is not the case that the person is the location of right.

when the move left with a person is made
    and a thing is current
    and the succ of the thing is a second thing
then the second thing is current
    and it is not the case that the thing is current.

when the move left with a person is made
    and a thing is a clock
    and the pace of the person is a second thing
    and a third thing = thing + second thing
then the third thing is a clock
    and it is not the case that the thing is a clock.

when the move left with a person and a second person is made
then left is a torch
    and the person is the location of left
    and the second person is the location of left
    and it is not the case that right is a torch
    and it is not the case that the person is the location of right
    and it is not the case that the second person is the location of right.

when the move left with a person and a second person is made
    and a thing is current
    and the succ of the thing is a second thing
then the second thing is current
    and it is not the case that the thing is current.

when the move left with a person and a second person is made
    and a thing is a clock
    and the pace of the person is a second thing
    and the pace of the second person is a third thing
    and the second thing >= the third thing
    and a fourth thing = thing + second thing
then it is not the case that the thing is a clock.

when the move left with a person and a second person is made
    and a thing is a clock
    and the pace of the person is a second thing
    and the pace of the second person is a third thing
    and the second thing < the third thing
    and a fourth thing = thing + third thing
then it is not the case that the thing is a clock.

when the move left with a person and a second person is made
    and a second thing is a clock
    and the pace of the person is a third thing
    and the pace of the second person is a fourth thing
    and the third thing >= the fourth thing
    and a thing = second thing + third thing
then the thing is a clock.

when the move left with a person and a second person is made
    and a second thing is a clock
    and the pace of the person is a third thing
    and the pace of the second person is a fourth thing
    and the third thing < the fourth thing
    and a thing = second thing + fourth thing
then the thing is a clock.

when the move right with a person is made
then right is a torch
    and the person is the location of right
    and it is not the case that left is a torch
    and it is not the case that the person is the location of left.

when the move right with a person is made
    and a thing is current
    and the succ of the thing is a second thing
then the second thing is current
    and it is not the case that the thing is current.

when the move right with a person is made
    and a thing is a clock
    and the pace of the person is a second thing
    and a third thing = thing + second thing
then the third thing is a clock
    and it is not the case that the thing is a clock.

when the move right with a person and a second person is made
then right is a torch
    and the person is the location of right
    and the second person is the location of right
    and it is not the case that left is a torch
    and it is not the case that the person is the location of left
    and it is not the case that the second person is the location of left.

when the move right with a person and a second person is made
    and a thing is current
    and the succ of the thing is a second thing
then the second thing is current
    and it is not the case that the thing is current.

when the move right with a person and a second person is made
    and a thing is a clock
    and the pace of the person is a second thing
    and the pace of the second person is a third thing
    and the second thing >= the third thing
    and a fourth thing = thing + second thing
then it is not the case that the thing is a clock.

when the move right with a person and a second person is made
    and a thing is a clock
    and the pace of the person is a second thing
    and the pace of the second person is a third thing
    and the second thing < the third thing
    and a fourth thing = thing + third thing
then it is not the case that the thing is a clock.

when the move right with a person and a second person is made
    and a second thing is a clock
    and the pace of the person is a third thing
    and the pace of the second person is a fourth thing
    and the third thing >= the fourth thing
    and a thing = second thing + third thing
then the thing is a clock.

when the move right with a person and a second person is made
    and a second thing is a clock
    and the pace of the person is a third thing
    and the pace of the second person is a fourth thing
    and the third thing < the fourth thing
    and a thing = second thing + fourth thing
then the thing is a clock.

it must not be true that
    the move left with a person is made
    and it is not the case that the move left with the person is legal.

it must not be true that
    the move left with a person and a second person is made
    and it is not the case that the move left with the person and the second person is legal.

it must not be true that
    the move right with a person is made
    and it is not the case that the move right with the person is legal.

it must not be true that
    the move right with a person and a second person is made
    and it is not the case that the move right with the person and the second person is legal.

initially "a" is the location of left
    and b is the location of left
    and c is the location of left
    and d is the location of left
    and left is a torch
    and 0 is a clock
    and 1 is current
    and robot is a control.

% EpilogJS's state after the play (the twin's final state under LPS2 must be the same):
%   - clock(16)
%   - control(robot)
%   - current(6)
%   - torch(right)
%   - location(a,left)
%   - location(b,left)
%   - location(c,right)
%   - location(d,right)
scenario play is:
    the move right with "a" is made from 1 to 2.
    the move left with "a" is made from 2 to 3.
    the move right with b is made from 3 to 4.
    the move left with b is made from 4 to 5.
    the move right with c and d is made from 5 to 6.

